    "out_trade_no"
  ],
  "compatibilityNotes": [
    "createOrder writes denormalized service fields plus provider_snapshot/merchant_service_snapshot; service_snapshot is kept as a historical compatibility field.",
    "address_snapshot and denormalized address fields are historical snapshots and should not be overwritten from later source records.",
    "provider_id/provider_type were introduced for merchant compatibility; older worker-only orders may only have worker_id.",
    "appointment_slot is the current persisted field; appointment_time_slot is a legacy client wording and should be normalized before write.",
    "真实云环境字段仍需按试运营数据回填校验。"
  ]
